{"parse": {"title": "7TH-17", "pageid": 55156, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-16\" title=\"7TH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-17</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-18\" title=\"7TH-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">17</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.A8.E5.B9.95.E6.BC.94.E8.AF.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雨幕演说\">雨幕演说</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雨幕演说</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The \"Storm\" Speech</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>少<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>解<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>用<span class=\"color-value\"></span>电<span class=\"color-value\"></span>器<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>作<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10717</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……鉴于我们时间紧张，请允许我略去无用的细节，只用最简单的比喻来解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员拔开白板笔的盖子，意气风发地在白板上画下几道线条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这一方案要解决的是血统限度的问题——低阶神秘学家无法驾驭高阶术式，就像家用电器无法承受高压电流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>多数情况的确如此，因为施术者使用的是自己血脉内的神秘学回路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>可如果施术者正处于一个特殊的电场内呢？假如我们能够借助外界已有的电路呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>在原来，用电器只有神秘学家自己，但如果我们加上了整个地球呢……？！如果我们使用整个大气来分摊电流呢？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>别犯傻了，阿德勒研究员，我们不是电器——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体眉头紧皱，显然，哑谜斑驳的前科使它对这场演讲一开始就充满了质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——别急，组长。先让我说完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人一言不发，仍认真聆听着，这多少给了他坚持下去的依据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白板笔转了个圈，在小人边上画下一个大圆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>在“暴雨”前的24小时里，整个世界都处于磅礴涌动的神秘学能量中。在那时外界就是一个溢满灵性的巨大术式，一个高压的放电云层——一个特殊的电场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我们一直苦苦寻找的免疫“暴雨”的关键成分，非对称核素R，甚至就光明正大地潜藏在大气里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这就像曼德拉草既是毒药也是解药，海浪同时做前进和后退的运动……解答从来就蕴含于问题之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>施术者自身不够的“神秘学能量”，完全可以从“暴雨”时期的外界借到——我们缺乏的，只是一根引线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而科算中心已经有了所有计算所需的数据，过去八年里我们搭建的观测体系并不是白费的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>完全可以建立一个数学公式，告诉我们血统为X的人，要从“暴雨”中借多少“灵性”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>然后，做一个帮助施术者从外界“借电”的转换器——限度的桎梏就不再存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——只需要一次计算，一次转换。我们，就可以让每个人都成为施术者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸开手臂，结束了自己激动的演讲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好在，意识唤醒者们大多没有表情，你很难从它们脸上判断出当下的心境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>……我真是后悔听你的废话，阿德勒研究员，你到底在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>首先，你构建了一个比喻体系，然后在这个比喻的逻辑里完成了推理——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——我承认，后半部分的确是纯理论。但我的出发点是正确的，我参考了神秘生物学专家的论文——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>但神秘学不是电！看在科学的面子上，你真是被突然复活的创意冲昏了头脑，才忽略了这么简单的道理！神秘学不是电学，你对它的原理一无所知——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但它是一种能量，对吧？我们谁也不知道“暴雨”的原理是什么，可它是一种巨大的神秘学能量场！我们理应可以利用它，就像神秘学家用术阵来增幅仪式效力——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，我明白阿德勒研究员的意思了。<br />这的确是一个很有创意的方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人从她的座位上站了起来，调停了这场争执。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>可是露西女士——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没关系，乌尔里希先生。我注意到人们总是在聪明的同时很愚蠢，也许这就是同行评议机制会存在的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>谢谢您的理解……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人充满善意地点点头，为自己学过的沟通技巧能派上用场而感到欣慰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>1939年，发明家克里安和他的妻子范伦缇娜发明了一种独特的高电压照相术，能拍摄出人体和物体发出的独特能量场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这项高电压电子照相术，成为了科算中心日后建立神秘学量化体系的依据，其成果也用在了今天的“暴雨”观测体系上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它能帮助我们捕捉，记录，测量那些不可见，但切实存在的神秘学“辉光”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不再浪费时间调停，机器下了决断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>阿德勒研究员的推论是可行的，科算中心也已经具备了实施的一切技术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们有“暴雨”观测站，有已经成功的施术者，也有优秀的计算人员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>乌尔里希先生，你去找约翰·提托小姐。让她主导公式计算。然后，你去安全区外做一次实验，记录下施术所需的灵性常量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——噢，记得不要把咒文内容告诉他们。我想总有人会忍不住念咒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体不情愿地嗡了一声，但仍迅速离开了办公室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>希曼，你去通知X研究员，他之前研发的“平衡头罩”可以作为转换器的原型。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这个头罩可以平衡外界和人体内的能量场，最早用来帮助研究员接触高危神秘术制品。我们只要把它增强，就能实现阿德勒研究员所说的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但是按下他们的试验申请。在副作用的研究完成前，不能进行任何实验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理鞠了一躬，开始起草一封文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>部署在一分钟内就结束了，没有多余的时间浪费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除了有人似乎被剩了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——那我呢，露西女士？我去协助公式计算，还是转换器研究……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜试探性地前进了一步，迫切想要知道自己在这一项目里的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，关于这一点，我正想和你探讨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是一个有突破性的构想，你证明了人类思维的有效性，很高兴酗酒并没有破坏你的智力水平，阿德勒研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我有信心它能在这次“暴雨”期间投入应用，拯救更多的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……酗酒？我已经戒酒七年了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露西仍是微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——但是你的方案漏了一件事，阿德勒研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你的种族，你的同胞——<b>人类要如何施术？</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一针见血的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……这个方案的确无法考虑到人类，因为我的设想建立在效率最大化的基础上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>要加入人类，只能寄希望于后续的免疫护具，在我们彻底掌握术式后，将它储存于神秘学科技制品中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>那么你现在应该继续完善它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——什……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>女士，距离“暴雨”落下只有十六小时零三十分钟了！！！我们没有时间再——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>方案的可行部分已经推行下去，整个科算中心都会来支持，你的构想绝不会被浪费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——但你必须完善这个方案，我们应该一视同仁地解救所有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在“暴雨”中进行实验的机会，只有这16.5个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毋庸置疑的指示，不存在任何模糊的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……明白了，我会想办法的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您是正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜大步离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露西身后，希曼也结束了文件起草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……阿德勒研究员不会没有想到人类的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>但他依然提交了这个方案。为了效率，战略性地放弃了自己的种族。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>您是否对他太过苛刻了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器不置可否地转过身去，重新坐回了实验台座上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-308612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——但这是正确的决断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>内线电话突然响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理放下了手里的副作用记录清单，接起了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……明白了，我们会提供一切可能的技术协助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话挂断了，助理的表情变得十分凝重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……露西女士，是芝诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>司辰小队在三个小时前就失去了一切通讯，他们询问科算中心是否可以提供技术支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>——他们必须马上联络到小岛上的我方人员。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508315.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-508315.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508315.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508315.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-508315.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508315.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-508315.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508315.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识在昏聩中沉浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挣扎着想要抓住一块浮木。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>别担心，苏菲亚，这只是个游戏！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我马上就会出来的——如果你担心的话，就在沙滩上等我，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浮木化成了泡沫，自怀中消散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508319.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-508319.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508319.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508319.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-508319.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508319.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-508319.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508319.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不，37，不要去——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_daoyu_shatan_hongzha2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，她在一块冰冷的石头上醒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……这儿……怎么会变成这样？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-17"}}